{
  "name": "bess-layout-designer",
  "version": "1.0.0-rc.1",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Preliminary BESS (Battery Energy Storage System) layout designer — draw site polygons, place equipment at real scale, compute KPIs, detect spacing/collision/out-of-bound issues, generate conceptual cable routes and access roads, and export a technical PDF report. Not a substitute for detailed electrical, civil, fire-protection or permitting engineering.",
